1
00:00:00,062 --> 00:00:03,402
- Maybe we should get you home.
- Hang on, hang on, hang on. Sheldon...

2
00:00:04,275 --> 00:00:07,235
(Amy:)...what would it take
for you to go into that Iiquor store...

3
00:00:07,403 --> 00:00:11,113
(Amy:)...buy a bottle of hooch, take me
across the street to that motel...

4
00:00:11,282 --> 00:00:13,452
(Amy:)...and have your way with me?

5
00:00:16,579 --> 00:00:18,659
(Leonard:)Yeah, Sheldon, what would it take?

6
00:00:22,168 --> 00:00:24,418
(Sheldon:)I'm begging both of you,
please, let's go.

7
00:00:25,296 --> 00:00:28,256
(Leonard:)Okay. Come on. Upsy-daisy.

8
00:00:28,424 --> 00:00:31,464
Whee. Ooh!
Finally, someone found second base.

9
00:00:36,682 --> 00:00:38,932
(Amy:)I know how you feel.

10
00:00:39,101 --> 00:00:42,481
(Amy:)I got a knife
slicing through my frontal lobe too.

11
00:00:44,690 --> 00:00:45,900
(Sheldon:)Hi.

12
00:00:46,442 --> 00:00:47,522
(Amy:)What do you want?

13
00:00:47,693 --> 00:00:50,193
(Amy:)Do you want me
to give the friendship bracelet back?

14
00:00:50,404 --> 00:00:52,824
(Penny:)I never gave you a friendship bracelet.

15
00:00:53,991 --> 00:00:56,661
When we met, I made one
and pretended you gave it to me.

16
00:00:56,827 --> 00:00:59,027
(Amy:)You can have it back if you want.

